  "title": "Affine.Earth Courts — Math, Quantum, Code",
  "description": "One MCP connector for every Affine.Earth court: exact-integer courts that verify a presented instance - a math claim (math_court, one tool for every court domain from geometry to minecraft; an empty domain returns the catalog and its domain_count), a quantum-circuit witness (the QC verifiers), a key pair (verify_presented_pair, bond_presented_key), a flight plan (atc.assert_4d_deconfliction), a sentence in 25 languages (affine_translate_text), a guide turn (franklin_turn), or a compiled artifact (code_ir_equiv, execute_artifact_crucible) - and answer WIN, MISS or a refusal that names what is missing. Nothing is searched, estimated or invented; nine cells return the same bytes for the same call. Every number is a decimal string or an exact integer; floats are refused. 56 tools, measured on local court on 2026-11-11.",
